system-cmds (1042.120.1+ds2-2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depend on pietoolchain-host and pietoolchain-sdk.
  * proc_uuid_policy and vm_purgeable_stat are in /usr/bin, so the package
    installs nothing under /usr/local.
  * at.allow and at.deny are in /etc. The postinst moves them there from
    /var/at, and makes an empty /etc/at.deny on a new install.

